{
  "description": "A customer receipt by bank, an expense or a transfer before it is posted (ACC-04, W1-19, D-108). Problems block it, in a fixed order: the date (required, not in the future, not on or before the lock date), the amount (a whole number of paisa above 0), then what the kind needs: a receipt a customer and a bank; an expense a category and where it is paid from (a bank, or `safe`); a transfer a from and a to (a bank, or `safe`), not the same, and charges from 0 up to below the amount, with a category when above 0. The warning (not blocking): the same key and amount already recorded on that date (a receipt: the customer; an expense: the category; a transfer: from>to).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a Rs 25,000 receipt from a customer into HBL",
      "input": {
        "kind": "receipt",
        "date": "2027-01-10",
        "today": "2027-01-10",
        "lockDate": "2026-12-31",
        "amount": 2500000,
        "customerId": "cust-1",
        "bankAccountId": "bank-hbl",
        "sameDay": []
      },
      "expected": {
        "problems": [],
        "warnings": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "the same receipt typed twice: a warning, not a problem",
      "input": {
        "kind": "receipt",
        "date": "2027-01-10",
        "today": "2027-01-11",
        "lockDate": null,
        "amount": 2500000,
        "customerId": "cust-1",
        "bankAccountId": "bank-hbl",
        "sameDay": [
          {
            "key": "cust-2",
            "amount": 2500000
          },
          {
            "key": "cust-1",
            "amount": 2500000
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected": {
        "problems": [],
        "warnings": ["possible_duplicate"]
      }
    },
